---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABlock from '../components/CTABlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Heurystics"
  description="Founder-led AI consultancy. Senior execution, direct access, measurable operational outcomes in weeks."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <h1 class="fade-up">Founder-led. Senior execution. Obsessive about operational outcomes.</h1>
      <p class="lead fade-up delay-1" style="margin-top: 16px;">
        Heurystics exists for one reason: to make your operations run themselves.
        No junior handoffs, no account managers in between. The people who design
        your system are the people who build and deploy it. That's how we ship
        results in weeks instead of quarters.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="team-grid">
        <!-- Aman -->
        <div class="team-member fade-up">
          <img src="/images/aman.jpg" alt="Aman — Technical lead at Heurystics" class="team-photo" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy" />
          <h3>Aman</h3>
          <span class="team-role">Technical lead</span>
          <p>8+ years building AI systems that run real operations. Retail chains, enterprise ad platforms, real estate brokerages. The through-line: take messy workflows that depend on people remembering things, and replace them with systems that don't forget.</p>
          <p>Designs the architecture, writes the code, and owns the deployment. From data pipelines and RAG systems to agent orchestration. Hands-on across the full stack.</p>
          <div class="team-tags">
            <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tag">Python</span>
            <span class="tag">Mastra</span>
            <span class="tag">MCP</span>
            <span class="tag">RAG</span>
            <span class="tag">AWS</span>
            <span class="tag">Supabase</span>
            <span class="tag">Turso</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pallav -->
        <div class="team-member fade-up delay-1">
          <img src="/images/pallav.jpg" alt="Pallav — Operations & Business lead at Heurystics" class="team-photo" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy" />
          <h3><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pallav-rawat-9aa50b70" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pallav</a></h3>
          <span class="team-role">Operations & Business lead</span>
          <p>A decade of operations and business strategy across enterprise and growth-stage companies. From Scania's manufacturing operations to startup go-to-market. Identifying bottlenecks, streamlining workflows, and delivering measurable improvements.</p>
          <p>Leads all client conversations, partnership development, and market positioning. Translates deep technical capability into business value and ensures every engagement delivers operational outcomes that matter.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why We Exist -->
  <section class="section section-limestone">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 640px; text-align: center;">
      <div class="editorial fade-up">
        <p>Companies are losing deals, leaking revenue, and burning hours on work that should be running itself. The data to fix all of it already exists inside their systems. Nobody is acting on it.</p>
        <p>We turn that data into outcomes. Fewer missed deadlines. Recovered commission revenue. Listings that launch the same day they're signed. Closing files that don't stall. These aren't promises on a roadmap. They're results you see in weeks.</p>
        <p>We don't sell software. We partner with the companies doing the work. Today that means brokerages, title companies, and escrow operations — the firms where operational gaps cost real money every week.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="process-timeline">
        <div class="process-step fade-up">
          <div class="process-circle">
            <span class="process-num mono">01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-content">
            <h4>Assessment <span class="process-meta">&middot; Free &middot; 30 min</span></h4>
            <p>We map your operational bottlenecks and show you exactly where time and money are leaking. You walk away with a prioritized action plan. No commitment, useful even if you never talk to us again.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process-line"></div>

        <div class="process-step fade-up delay-1">
          <div class="process-circle">
            <span class="process-num mono">02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-content">
            <h4>Pilot <span class="process-meta">&middot; 2-4 weeks</span></h4>
            <p>We pick the highest-impact problem and solve it. You see the first measurable result. Real data, your workflows, your systems. If the outcome doesn't speak for itself, we part ways.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process-line"></div>

        <div class="process-step fade-up delay-2">
          <div class="process-circle">
            <span class="process-num mono">03</span>
          </div>
          <div class="process-content">
            <h4>Scale <span class="process-meta">&middot; Your call</span></h4>
            <p>Once the first problem is solved, you decide what's next. Most clients expand to additional workflows because the ROI is obvious. Your data stays in your environment. You own everything we build.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABlock />

</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .team-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .team-member {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .team-avatar {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 28px;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .navy-avatar { background: var(--navy); }
  .ochre-avatar { background: var(--ochre); }

  .team-role {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ochre);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .team-member p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--driftwood);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .team-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .team-note {
    font-size: 13px !important;
    color: var(--sandstone) !important;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Editorial */
  .editorial p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
  }

  .editorial p + p {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  /* Process timeline */
  .process-timeline {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .process-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .process-circle {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--limestone);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--nordic-light);
  }

  .process-num {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .process-content {
    flex: 1;
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  .process-content h4 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .process-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--sandstone);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .process-content p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--driftwood);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .process-line {
    width: 2px;
    height: 32px;
    background: var(--limestone);
    margin-left: 27px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .team-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
